  * Renamed project `wpantund`. Executible is still named `wpan-tunnel-driver` (for now)
* Updated `man` pages for `wpanctl` and `wpan-tunnel-driver`.
* `getopt` is now used for parsing all command line arguments.
* string-utils: Properly handle interpreting the last nibble when parsing hexidecimal data blobs
* wpantund: Interface properties are now case-insensitive.
* wpantund: Support for hardware reset and explicit power-state control of NCP.
* wpantund: Lowered the amount of default logging slightly.
* wpantund: Moved property key macros to an independent header file.
* wpantund: Handle `/etc/wpantund.conf` in addition to `/etc/wpan-tunnel-driver.conf`.
* wpanctl: Now supports tab-completion, when compiled with libreadline or libedit
* wpanctl: Add channel option to scan command
* wpanctl: Fix for scan crash when there are lots of networks
* wpanctl: Support strings to name a node type
* wpanctl: Improved channel mask format for the `scan` command. (`-c 11-14,17,20-23`)
* ncp-connectip: Better, more reliable sleep behavior.
* ncp-connectip: Now supports ConnectIP-2.0.0b420, with issues.
* ncp-connectip: Fixed minor bugs with support for some SiLabs manufacturing commands.
* ncp-connectip: Added the ability to specify a ULA when joining a network.
* ncp-connectip: Fixed issue when using the default port for `PermitJoin`
* ncp-connectip: Preliminary support for separate legacy and mesh-local prefixes.
* configure: Added `--enable-ash-v3-debug` option to configure script.
* build-system: `make distclean` now works properly on systems with versions of `tar` that maxes out filenames at 99 characters.
* build-system: Clean up output of bootstrap script.
* build-system: Added pkg.m4, which contains config macros for pkg-config
* build-system: Better git integration into version reporting (specifically in tarballs made from `make dist`)
* README: Updated list of contributors.

